<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>隐私 on Svtter's Blog</title><link>https://svtter.cn/tags/%E9%9A%90%E7%A7%81/</link><description>Recent content in 隐私 on Svtter's Blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://svtter.cn/tags/%E9%9A%90%E7%A7%81/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>便宜且不留存：用 OpenRouter 路由 DeepSeek-V4-Flash</title><link>https://svtter.cn/p/%E4%BE%BF%E5%AE%9C%E4%B8%94%E4%B8%8D%E7%95%99%E5%AD%98%E7%94%A8-openrouter-%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1-deepseek-v4-flash/</link><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://svtter.cn/p/%E4%BE%BF%E5%AE%9C%E4%B8%94%E4%B8%8D%E7%95%99%E5%AD%98%E7%94%A8-openrouter-%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1-deepseek-v4-flash/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;DeepSeek 官方 API 从 2026-08-16 起峰谷分时计费。flash 峰段（北京时间 09:00–12:00、14:00–18:00）cache miss $0.44、output $1.32 per 1M（¥3.17/¥9.50），相对旧价 $0.14/$0.28 涨了 3 到 4.6 倍。我的用量，agent 会话和 cron 任务，全在峰段。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;v4-flash 我用得很多，之前写过&lt;a href="https://svtter.cn/p/%E5%AE%9E%E6%B5%8B-deepseek-%E5%89%8D%E7%BC%80%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%E5%89%8D%E7%BC%80%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E5%90%8E%E7%BC%80%E8%BF%98%E8%83%BD%E5%91%BD%E4%B8%AD%E5%90%97/"&gt;前缀缓存实测&lt;/a&gt;和 &lt;a href="https://svtter.cn/p/siliconflow-%E7%9A%84-deepseek-v4-flash-%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%E5%91%BD%E4%B8%AD%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E4%BD%86%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%80%E5%B0%8F-token-%E9%98%88%E5%80%BC/"&gt;SiliconFlow 缓存阈值&lt;/a&gt;。这次给它找条出路，要求两条：比官方便宜，数据不留存（ZDR）。查下来 OpenRouter 能同时满足，中间踩了几个坑。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>